  "description": "MongoDB store for DotNetBoost.Auditing. One collection, one document per recorded change with\n      its property changes embedded — an entry is an aggregate that is written once and read whole,\n      so it is one document rather than two collections, and the per-property question stays\n      answerable through a multikey index. Recording is explicit rather than captured: there is no\n      change tracker to read.",
